    "properties": "The property pool (W25 step 6). weights: how likely each is per item family; 0 never rolls on that family. fx: what it does in a fight or in deck editing (model/itemProperties.js summarises, the engine reads); stats: stat points it adds (the gear receipt). Owner 2026-11-17 (#2820 review): the stance-attribute properties (+2 STR / DEX / INT in a stance) roll on relics only; armour and armaments grant no AR, DR or PR (owner, 2026-11-18: they are no longer stats)."
