    "$note": {
      "stones": "Smithing Stones a category change costs.",
      "cinders": "Cinders a category change costs. The player keeps up to (the weapon's upgrade count, at least 1) of its old properties; 1 to 1 + upgrade count new ones are rolled from the new category's pool, lower counts likelier."
    }
  }
